  },
  {
   "id": "cb_987efed6881cb9a9775d8030",
   "order": 72,
   "title_en": "Highlights",
   "body_en": "• 55W CO2 Laser: Cut and engrave wood, clear acrylic, leather, and more, with materials up to 20 mm thick in a single pass.\n• Large Work Area: 600 × 300 mm, or up to 3000 mm long stock with the Conveyor.\n• Auto Laser Alignment: Hands-free optical path calibration in about a minute. No thermal paper, no test shots.\n• TriSense System: Cameras, lasers and XY encoders combined for positioning accuracy within 0.2 mm.\n• Vibration Compensation: Cancels residual shake after a turn for clean, crisp lines.\n• High-Speed Engraving: Up to 1000 mm/s with 20,000 mm/s² acceleration.\n• Class 1 Laser Safety: Fully enclosed beam in normal use, with lid-stop, flame detection and emergency stop.",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "",
   "source_url": "",
